  "messages": {
    "continue_assessment": "The configured safety screen is complete. Continue the clinical assessment; this screen does not establish a diagnosis or rule out serious illness.",
    "needs_clarification": "More information is needed before this assessment can continue. Please clarify the unanswered or conflicting screening questions. If you have severe or rapidly worsening symptoms, seek medical help immediately.",
    "clinician_review": "This concern needs a clinician's assessment outside the prototype's routine pathway. Arrange a medical review. If you have severe or rapidly worsening symptoms, seek medical help immediately.",
    "urgent_review": "Please seek urgent medical assessment today. If symptoms are severe, rapidly worsening, or you cannot obtain prompt care, go to an Emergency Department. For a life-threatening emergency in Singapore, call 995.",
    "emergency": "Please seek emergency medical assessment now. Call 995 in Singapore if you are having difficulty breathing, chest pain, stroke symptoms, uncontrolled bleeding, a seizure or loss of consciousness, or cannot travel safely. Do not wait for more chatbot questions."
  },
